# One writer per path. This file is the enforcement half of the ownership table
# in factory/GOVERNANCE-SHARED-DESIGN.md §3 — a shared repo that does not name an
# owner per path is a place everyone writes, and drift there is invisible.
#
# Most specific wins: the backend owns api-docs inside its own partition and
# nothing else; the factory owns everything it derives.

/platform/                  @hesham421
/backend/modules/*/api-docs/ @hesham421
/backend/                   @hesham421
/frontend/                  @hesham421
